      <div class="deets-story-label-track">
        <h2 class="deets-node deets-label deets-story-label" data-appear>(my story)</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="deets-story-column">
        <p class="deets-node deets-story-lead deets-desktop-copy" data-appear>Most portfolio intros make everyone sound like a visionary with a caffeine problem, so here’s the less polished version. How did I get here? Let’s rewind.</p>
        <p class="deets-node deets-story-lead deets-mobile-copy" data-appear>Most portfolio intros make everyone sound like a visionary with a caffeine problem, so here’s the less polished version. How did I get here? Let’s rewind.</p>
        <div class="deets-story-row">
          <p class="deets-node deets-body deets-story-one" data-appear>
            <span class="deets-desktop-copy">I grew up in my dad’s carpentry shop, where my siblings and I spent our days among design magazines, books, house and furniture sketches, an unreasonable number of Worms matches, decor objects, fabric scraps, and every kind of office stationery.</span>
            <span class="deets-mobile-copy">I grew up in my dad’s carpentry shop, where my siblings and I spent our days among design magazines, books, house and furniture sketches, an unreasonable number of Worms matches, decor objects, fabric scraps, and every kind of office stationery.</span>
          </p>
          <p class="deets-node deets-body deets-story-two" data-appear>
            <span class="deets-desktop-copy">From there, the obsession only grew. I decided that when I grew up, I would design magazines and books. I didn’t know this profession had a name until I met Anna, my graphic design teacher, during my final years of high school. Her first assignment? Designing a magazine cover. Obviously.</span>
            <span class="deets-mobile-copy">From there, the obsession only grew. I decided that when I grew up, I would design magazines and books.<br />I didn’t know this profession had a name until I met Anna—my graphic design teacher, during my final years of high school. Her first assignment? Designing a magazine cover. Obviously.</span>
          </p>

        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="deets-story-images">
        <figure data-parallax class="deets-node deets-image deets-image-three" data-appear>
          <img src={cap.src} alt={cap.alt} width={cap.width} height={cap.height} loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
        </figure>
        <figure data-parallax class="deets-node deets-image deets-image-four" data-appear>
          <img src={laptop.src} alt={laptop.alt} width={laptop.width} height={laptop.height} loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
        </figure>
      </div>

      <div class="deets-story-row deets-story-row-late">
        <p class="deets-node deets-body deets-story-three" data-appear>
          <span class="deets-desktop-copy">That was the beginning of a long, slightly obsessive relationship with design. I knew I had found the field I wanted to stay in, and I haven’t stopped learning, experimenting, or finding new ways to push it since.</span>
          <span class="deets-mobile-copy">That was the beginning of a long, slightly obsessive relationship with design. I knew I had found the field I wanted to stay in, and I haven’t stopped learning, experimenting, or finding new ways to push it since.</span>
        </p>
        <p class="deets-node deets-body deets-story-four" data-appear>
          <span class="deets-desktop-copy">Since then, I’ve worked across analog craft, print, web and product design—still my favorite territory—as well as illustration, photography, image-making, and motion. I use whichever medium helps an idea become clearer, stranger, or more memorable.</span>
          <span class="deets-mobile-copy">Since then, I’ve worked across analog craft, print, web and product design—still my favorite territory—as well as illustration, photography, image-making, and motion. I use whichever medium helps an idea become clearer, stranger, or more memorable.</span>
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="deets-story-column deets-closing">
